+ BooleanWorkspace
    is Usable'Void

` Caller-owned storage for repeated boolean queries. Output is written into a caller-owned Path.
` A workspace is single-call-owned: nested or concurrent operations must use distinct instances.
+ growth-count Size
+ clear-count Size

_ in-use = false
_ intersection-workspace = IntersectionWorkspace()
_ intersections [CurveIntersection]
_ self-intersections1 [CurveIntersection]
_ self-intersections2 [CurveIntersection]
_ hits [CurveIntersection]
_ bounds1 [Rect]
_ bounds2 [Rect]
_ class-spans1 [BooleanClassSpan]
_ class-spans2 [BooleanClassSpan]
_ contour-bounds1 [Rect]
_ contour-bounds2 [Rect]
_ subpath-spans [PathSubpathSpan]
_ empty-path = Path()
_ spans1 [BooleanOutputSpan]
_ spans2 [BooleanOutputSpan]
_ splits [PointOnCurve]
_ edges [BooleanSpanEdge]
_ edge-count Size
_ contour-edges [BooleanSpanEdge]
_ flat1 = Path()
_ flat2 = Path()
_ points1 [Point]
_ points2 [Point]
_ line-splits [Float]
_ line-edges [BooleanEdge]
_ line-edge-count Size
_ rect-subpaths [PathSubpathSpan]
_ rect-pieces [Rect]
_ rect-next [Rect]

