━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do rect-intersection
    - a Rect
    - b Rect

=? if right <= left
=? if bottom <= top

= Rect(left, top, right - left, bottom - top)

.. left = max(a.left, b.left)
.. top = max(a.top, b.top)
.. right = min(a.right, b.right)
.. bottom = min(a.bottom, b.bottom)

