_ do append-curve-span-split
    - splits [PointOnCurve]
    - t PointOnCurve
    - curve-index Index

. i = t as Index
=? if i != curve-index
. local = t - i
if local > tolerance && local < 1 - tolerance
    splits += local
    //graphics.boolean.curve-splits ++

